WEBVTT

00:00:12.660 --> 00:00:15.200
My sweet precious!

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:20.910
How have you been? It's Papa!
I know you missed me.

00:00:20.910 --> 00:00:26.540
Now, come leaping into my arms, Yumemi and Kana!

00:00:30.660 --> 00:00:34.790
Papa-- I mean, Father, welcome home.

00:00:34.790 --> 00:00:37.040
Father, welcome home.

00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:41.540
You have arrived at the perfect time.
Would you like some, as well?

00:00:41.540 --> 00:00:42.700
Yes...

00:00:44.080 --> 00:00:50.700
Of course... At least I wish I could,
but I must get back right away.

00:00:52.330 --> 00:00:54.290
Then why are you here?

00:00:54.290 --> 00:00:59.040
Why, to see my adorable
daughters' faces, isn't that obvious?

00:01:01.080 --> 00:01:04.200
When is Mother coming back?

00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:08.120
Unfortunately, it looks like that's
going to be a little while longer.

00:01:08.120 --> 00:01:14.370
But don't be sad, my precious.
My heart feels like it's about to burst, too.

00:01:14.370 --> 00:01:16.910
We know it isn't your fault, Papa.

00:01:16.910 --> 00:01:22.750
My dear princesses,
Maeve and I both love you two.

00:01:22.750 --> 00:01:26.040
Mm-hmm, we know.

00:01:26.040 --> 00:01:29.620
Well, I'll be off, then. I have a stage show,

00:01:29.620 --> 00:01:33.580
but also, the people who go after
Artifacts have really been at it lately.

00:01:33.580 --> 00:01:37.040
Also, I need to check into what's
happening in Lároutir Village.

00:01:37.040 --> 00:01:40.160
Makoto-<i>kun</i>, Ema, take good
care of these two for me.

00:01:40.160 --> 00:01:42.500
Keep them safe from all danger.

00:01:42.500 --> 00:01:43.160
--Right.

00:01:43.160 --> 00:01:43.500
--As you wish, Master.
--Right.

00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:45.000
--As you wish, Master.

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:47.580
All right, I'll leave the house in your hands.

00:01:58.290 --> 00:02:01.290
Oh, I forgot to mention one thing!

00:02:01.290 --> 00:02:06.950
Makoto-<i>kun</i>, I asked <i>my </i>master
to teach you how to be a magician.

00:02:06.950 --> 00:02:08.500
<i>Your </i>master, Master?

00:02:08.500 --> 00:02:12.580
My master will be visiting you
in the not-too-distant future.

00:02:12.580 --> 00:02:15.700
Until then, look forward in anticipation.

00:02:30.330 --> 00:02:33.450
<i>Tell me, do you remember?</i>

00:02:33.450 --> 00:02:37.370
<i>Yes, the wondrous God-given power you have,</i>

00:02:37.370 --> 00:02:43.200
<i>like sleight of hand without any tricks?</i>

00:02:43.200 --> 00:02:47.000
<i>Tell me, have you already forgotten?</i>

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:50.160
<i>Those dreamlike, heart-shaped</i>

00:02:50.160 --> 00:02:55.540
<i>flower-bouquet-like words of yours?</i>

00:02:55.540 --> 00:03:01.790
<i>I'm sure, I'm sure</i>

00:03:01.790 --> 00:03:05.410
<i>this key will open your treasure box</i>

00:03:05.410 --> 00:03:11.660
<i>and let you remember them tonight</i>

00:03:11.660 --> 00:03:14.540
<i>Farewell!</i>

00:03:14.540 --> 00:03:15.870
<i>Watch me now,</i>

00:03:15.870 --> 00:03:19.080
<i>I'm gently, quietly going to disappear,</i>

00:03:19.080 --> 00:03:21.000
<i>so find me</i>

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:22.200
<i>I'm over here</i>

00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:27.330
<i>Our long, long night of secrets is beginning</i>

00:03:27.330 --> 00:03:28.620
<i>Come after me</i>

00:03:28.620 --> 00:03:33.790
<i>Once you see the twinkle of my tearstains,</i>

00:03:33.790 --> 00:03:36.660
<i>catch me with your voice</i>

00:03:36.660 --> 00:03:41.370
<i>and the magic words only the two of us know</i>

00:03:47.660 --> 00:03:49.080
Mother...

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:52.950
He said that some trouble
had arisen with Grandmother.

00:03:52.950 --> 00:03:55.700
Yeah, I get that, but...

00:03:56.830 --> 00:03:58.830
That perfume...

00:04:00.370 --> 00:04:01.580
Auntie?!

00:04:01.580 --> 00:04:04.580
I've asked you not to call me that, haven't I?

00:04:04.580 --> 00:04:06.790
How did you get in here?

00:04:06.790 --> 00:04:11.580
This mansion belongs to the
whole family. Of course I can get in.

00:04:11.580 --> 00:04:14.370
I am Maeve's younger sister, after all.

00:04:14.370 --> 00:04:17.540
After everything you've done,
you've got some nerve saying that!

00:04:17.540 --> 00:04:19.250
Everything I've done?

00:04:19.250 --> 00:04:24.200
You tricked me, and as a result, I ended up...

00:04:24.200 --> 00:04:26.120
...going through <i>that</i>...

00:04:27.410 --> 00:04:30.830
You brought that upon yourself,
due to your inexperience.

00:04:30.830 --> 00:04:37.000
If you had only mastered your Artifact,
none of that would have happened.

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:40.370
Don't you remember what I said to you back then?

00:04:40.370 --> 00:04:44.370
Your muffler moves according to your will.

00:04:44.370 --> 00:04:47.080
You have not issued
instructions to your Artifact.

00:04:47.080 --> 00:04:50.290
You have not mastered it at all.

00:04:50.290 --> 00:04:54.330
But I <i>do </i>give it instructions!
I ask Muff-<i>kun </i>to do lots of things!

00:04:54.330 --> 00:04:58.750
And your Artifact takes your
requests into consideration, right?

00:04:58.750 --> 00:05:02.450
That's not what I mean; you need to
have a more definitive arrangement.

00:05:02.450 --> 00:05:03.790
Arrangement?

00:05:03.790 --> 00:05:09.950
Like "Turn into a sword," or even
"Become a shield and ward off attacks."

00:05:09.950 --> 00:05:13.790
You need to make arrangements
ahead of time with your Artifact

00:05:13.790 --> 00:05:16.540
so you can execute commands
with a minimum of words.

00:05:16.540 --> 00:05:19.790
You mean like a programmed command?

00:05:19.790 --> 00:05:21.410
A nice comparison.

00:05:22.450 --> 00:05:26.830
It looks like your younger sister
has a sharper noggin than you do.

00:05:28.410 --> 00:05:31.120
This isn't what I came to talk about, though.

00:05:31.120 --> 00:05:35.830
I'm here today because I need
to see Jeeves. Go get him for me.

00:05:38.910 --> 00:05:40.580
Ready, Muff-<i>kun</i>?

00:05:40.580 --> 00:05:44.410
Command 1 is "Handkerchief."
Become a handkerchief.

00:05:45.580 --> 00:05:47.950
Command 2 is "Jump,"

00:05:47.950 --> 00:05:50.870
and Command 3 is "Sword."
That means turn into a sword. Got it?

00:05:50.870 --> 00:05:51.910
"Tominozawa"
and Command 3 is "Sword."
That means turn into a sword. Got it?

00:05:51.910 --> 00:05:53.080
"Enemy"
"Tominozawa"
and Command 3 is "Sword."
That means turn into a sword. Got it?

00:05:53.080 --> 00:05:53.250
"Mariah"
and Command 3 is "Sword."
That means turn into a sword. Got it?

00:05:53.250 --> 00:05:54.080
"Mariah"
All right, then...

00:05:54.080 --> 00:05:54.790
"Take down"
"Mariah"
All right, then...

00:05:54.790 --> 00:05:55.040
All right, then...

00:05:55.040 --> 00:05:57.540
Command 2, Muff-<i>kun</i>!

00:05:58.580 --> 00:06:03.750
No, Command 2 is "Jump"! You have to jump!

00:06:03.750 --> 00:06:06.700
Muff-<i>kun</i>, what's the point of only <i>you </i>jumping?!

00:06:11.450 --> 00:06:14.660
Muff-<i>kun</i>, you're supposed to launch me!

00:06:16.000 --> 00:06:18.040
Huh? No way!

00:06:19.040 --> 00:06:20.160
Hatena!

00:06:21.200 --> 00:06:22.660
Watch out!

00:06:23.750 --> 00:06:25.000
Huh?

00:06:29.160 --> 00:06:30.870
Thank goodness!

00:06:35.160 --> 00:06:37.540
D-D-Did you look?

00:06:37.540 --> 00:06:40.040
No, I didn't! And you're wearing tights anyway!

00:06:40.040 --> 00:06:43.160
Tights or not, you still looked!
You were staring!

00:06:43.160 --> 00:06:45.370
You sicko! You pervert! You peeker!

00:06:45.370 --> 00:06:46.620
Peeker?

00:06:46.620 --> 00:06:48.410
Don't look at me, dummy!

00:06:48.410 --> 00:06:52.330
S-Sorry! I-I mean, hurry up and come back down!

00:06:52.330 --> 00:06:53.950
Makoto, you go over there!

00:06:53.950 --> 00:06:56.250
I was just trying to save you, Hatena!

00:06:56.250 --> 00:06:58.250
I told you not to call me Hatena!

00:06:58.250 --> 00:06:59.410
Okay, "Kana"!

00:06:59.410 --> 00:07:00.370
Don't call me "Kana," either!

00:07:00.370 --> 00:07:01.950
Just come on down!

00:07:01.950 --> 00:07:03.410
Not until you move, sicko!

00:07:03.410 --> 00:07:08.120
Big sister, be quiet! I can't meditate!

00:07:08.120 --> 00:07:09.910
--Sorry.
--Sorry.

00:07:12.000 --> 00:07:15.830
It doesn't seem like having Muff-<i>kun</i>
learn commands is going too well.

00:07:15.830 --> 00:07:22.080
Mm-mm. I tried what Auntie said,
but maybe she's wrong.

00:07:22.080 --> 00:07:24.540
No, she's not.

00:07:24.540 --> 00:07:28.580
I think what Auntie said makes a lot of sense.

00:07:28.580 --> 00:07:30.120
But...

00:07:30.120 --> 00:07:32.540
She's right. Maybe you should
keep at it a little longer

00:07:32.540 --> 00:07:35.410
before deciding whether it will work or not.

00:07:35.410 --> 00:07:36.910
You, too, Yumemi-<i>chan</i>.

00:07:36.910 --> 00:07:38.250
Mm-hmm.

00:07:38.250 --> 00:07:42.700
But I can't concentrate
with you here, big sister.

00:07:42.700 --> 00:07:45.000
Yumemi, you listen to me...

00:07:45.000 --> 00:07:48.620
Your training does not appear to be going well.

00:07:48.620 --> 00:07:52.290
Mental training is hard.

00:07:52.290 --> 00:07:56.870
Maybe I should think of some
other method besides meditating.

00:07:56.870 --> 00:08:00.080
Then allow me to come up
with a means of mental training

00:08:00.080 --> 00:08:03.950
that will fit in with your
development, Yumemi-<i>sama</i>.

00:08:05.250 --> 00:08:07.620
Ema-<i>san</i>, nothing too radical.

00:08:07.620 --> 00:08:12.660
Not to worry, Makoto-<i>sama</i>.
I was thinking of waterfall meditation.

00:08:12.660 --> 00:08:15.500
I don't like getting wet.

00:08:15.500 --> 00:08:20.870
Yumemi-<i>sama</i>, waterfall meditation
is the ideal way to train your mind.

00:08:20.870 --> 00:08:23.290
I am sure it will be effective.

00:08:26.290 --> 00:08:29.330
All right. I'll try it.

00:08:29.330 --> 00:08:33.330
That is my Yumemi-<i>sama</i>!
Kana-<i>sama</i>, would you like to join us?

00:08:33.330 --> 00:08:38.790
Huh?! But then, if it will improve
my magic control, I may give it a try.

00:08:38.790 --> 00:08:40.500
All right, then I will count you in.

00:08:40.500 --> 00:08:42.080
No, wait!

00:08:42.080 --> 00:08:45.200
Ema-<i>san</i>, would it be okay if I did it, too?

00:08:45.200 --> 00:08:49.410
If I can train my mental ability,
it may improve my magic skills, too.

00:08:49.410 --> 00:08:51.580
Of course you cannot.

00:08:56.750 --> 00:09:00.660
I didn't think we would be doing
waterfall meditation at home.

00:09:00.660 --> 00:09:03.410
Ema-<i>san</i>, how did you do this?

00:09:03.410 --> 00:09:06.410
Why, by using an Artifact, of course.

00:09:10.040 --> 00:09:13.120
I never knew about that Artifact.

00:09:13.120 --> 00:09:17.870
Now, Mistresses, off you go to train your minds.

00:09:18.950 --> 00:09:22.160
All right, let's do this! Muff-<i>kun</i>!

00:09:23.290 --> 00:09:26.080
Kana-<i>sama</i>, you are more than fired up.

00:09:30.410 --> 00:09:33.790
This actually kind of feels good.

00:09:33.790 --> 00:09:35.410
No it doesn't.

00:09:35.410 --> 00:09:39.080
Simply having the waterfall
hit you is not enough.

00:09:39.080 --> 00:09:43.580
Please meditate and become aware
of the magic flowing through your bodies.

00:09:43.580 --> 00:09:44.830
Right!

00:09:47.200 --> 00:09:48.660
You seem to have become acclimated,

00:09:48.660 --> 00:09:51.290
so I will increase the volume of water a bit.

00:09:53.790 --> 00:09:57.200
E-Ema-<i>san</i>, too strong!

00:09:58.830 --> 00:10:00.870
It hurts...

00:10:07.200 --> 00:10:09.000
Big sister!

00:10:10.040 --> 00:10:11.750
Yumemi!

00:10:14.330 --> 00:10:17.000
Such beautiful sisterly love!

00:10:17.000 --> 00:10:22.080
However, the two of you must
still endure this intense trial.

00:10:26.580 --> 00:10:31.160
E-Ema-<i>san</i>, th-this is too...

00:10:36.040 --> 00:10:39.620
It was hopeless to fight against destiny.

00:10:44.660 --> 00:10:48.200
Ah! What a tender sight this is!

00:10:48.200 --> 00:10:52.080
Denying Makoto-<i>sama</i>'s participation
was the right call after all.

00:11:05.500 --> 00:11:08.580
Good work, guys!
How was the waterfall meditation?

00:11:08.580 --> 00:11:12.660
Oh, they achieved tremendous results.

00:11:12.660 --> 00:11:17.160
Then I wish I could have
done it together with you.

00:11:20.700 --> 00:11:26.750
No, no, no, no, no, no, no, no,
no, no, no, no, no! Absolutely not!

00:11:29.080 --> 00:11:33.410
So sleepy... Don't want to go to school...

00:11:33.410 --> 00:11:36.580
You stayed up too late, despite being
worn out from the waterfall training.

00:11:36.580 --> 00:11:38.370
That's not good for you.

00:11:38.370 --> 00:11:43.330
Not getting enough sleep does
indeed negatively impact one's health.

00:11:43.330 --> 00:11:45.160
You are absolutely right.

00:11:45.160 --> 00:11:50.410
I require sleep to resolve this.
Good night, big sister.

00:11:50.410 --> 00:11:53.790
Now, just a minute!
I won't have you playing hooky!

00:11:53.790 --> 00:11:56.870
It's for health reasons, so it isn't hooky.

00:11:56.870 --> 00:12:03.160
Mistress Yumemi stayed up late into
the night practicing making Artifacts.

00:12:03.160 --> 00:12:05.580
That is probably the reason.

00:12:05.580 --> 00:12:08.250
Yumemi, you shouldn't overexert yourself!

00:12:08.250 --> 00:12:10.500
You're overexerting yourself, aren't you?

00:12:10.500 --> 00:12:12.790
I-I am not either overexerting myself.

00:12:12.790 --> 00:12:17.750
Are so. You've been
working Muff-<i>kun </i>all this time.

00:12:17.750 --> 00:12:22.200
You keep saying to yourself
"Spear form" and "Shield form" and stuff.

00:12:22.200 --> 00:12:27.950
I-I just thought it would be easier
for Muff-kun than "Command 1" or "2."

00:12:28.950 --> 00:12:31.500
Studying is the duty of a student.

00:12:31.500 --> 00:12:34.660
I'm good at studying. No worries there.

00:12:34.660 --> 00:12:39.450
Yumemi-<i>sama</i>, physical education
is an important subject, too.

00:12:39.450 --> 00:12:41.160
That was mean.

00:12:49.540 --> 00:12:51.330
Oh, come to think of it, Makoto-<i>sama</i>,

00:12:51.330 --> 00:12:54.540
this must be the first time
I have shown you this functionality.

00:12:54.540 --> 00:12:56.580
That's quite the handy Artifact.

00:12:56.580 --> 00:13:03.080
Yes. It is handy... and very important.

00:13:04.500 --> 00:13:08.040
Well, I have student council
business to deal with today,

00:13:08.040 --> 00:13:10.950
so I will go on ahead without you.

00:13:13.450 --> 00:13:18.540
Kana-<i>sama</i>, please take good
care of Yumemi-<i>sama </i>for me.

00:13:18.540 --> 00:13:20.830
Yeah! I'm on the case!

00:13:31.580 --> 00:13:35.660
Welcome to Japan. We have been expecting you.

00:13:35.660 --> 00:13:37.910
I told you!

00:13:37.910 --> 00:13:43.200
This is Command 3!
Command 3! Do you get it now?!

00:13:43.200 --> 00:13:47.790
Three is "Sword"! You turn into a sword!

00:13:47.790 --> 00:13:55.080
Everyone, we have visitors.
Please come to the reception room.

00:13:55.080 --> 00:13:58.040
This is Mr. Gregory Camelot.

00:13:58.040 --> 00:14:02.250
He is a longtime friend of
my mother, Morrigan Lároutir.

00:14:03.580 --> 00:14:05.790
Next to him is...

00:14:05.790 --> 00:14:10.000
My name is Dina Camelot. It is a
pleasure to make your acquaintance.

00:14:10.000 --> 00:14:14.620
The two of them will be staying
with us here in the mansion for a bit,

00:14:14.620 --> 00:14:16.580
so please see that they are attended to.

00:14:16.580 --> 00:14:19.700
Why do you get to decide such a thing?

00:14:19.700 --> 00:14:27.040
Mistress Kana, he is not here
merely as a friend of Morrigan-<i>sama</i>.

00:14:27.040 --> 00:14:30.080
He is also a guest of Mamoru-<i>sama</i>.

00:14:30.080 --> 00:14:34.540
Camelot-<i>sama </i>is the one who taught
Mamoru-<i>sama </i>how to perform magic.

00:14:34.540 --> 00:14:38.750
Master Mamoru? Then that makes you...

00:14:38.750 --> 00:14:43.000
Sir Camelot! Wow! I'm a huge fan!

00:14:43.000 --> 00:14:46.200
The greatest illusionist in all
of Britain, and a gentleman--

00:14:46.200 --> 00:14:50.200
a magician who was granted
the title of "sir" by Her Majesty!

00:14:50.200 --> 00:14:54.870
Your vanishing trick, the one they call
the Miracle of Big Ben, is still legendary!

00:14:54.870 --> 00:14:57.580
Oh, that was a long time ago.

00:14:57.580 --> 00:15:01.290
Someday, I, too, want to be a magician like you,

00:15:01.290 --> 00:15:04.040
who can thrill and delight large audiences!

00:15:04.040 --> 00:15:09.040
I have watched videos of your
stage shows over and over again!

00:15:09.040 --> 00:15:13.870
Makoto-<i>niisama</i>, I've never
heard you talk so loud before.

00:15:13.870 --> 00:15:15.040
Same here.

00:15:15.040 --> 00:15:17.910
S-Sorry, I couldn't help myself.

00:15:17.910 --> 00:15:22.120
Hmm, so you are the lad that
Mamoru took on as an apprentice.

00:15:22.120 --> 00:15:25.450
Y-Yes. I'm Shiranui Makoto.

00:15:25.450 --> 00:15:28.370
Sir Camelot has come all the
way here from Great Britain

00:15:28.370 --> 00:15:33.450
at Mamoru-<i>san</i>'s request to teach Makoto-<i>kun</i>.

00:15:33.450 --> 00:15:38.290
It wasn't for Mamoru.
Maeve was quite insistent that I come,

00:15:38.290 --> 00:15:41.000
so I'm stopping by, since I have
a performance here in Japan anyway.

00:15:41.000 --> 00:15:46.120
Sure, sure. You were asked by my sister
after she was asked by Mamoru-<i>san</i>.

00:15:46.120 --> 00:15:49.580
Sir Camelot, I look forward
to learning from you.

00:15:51.790 --> 00:15:56.540
I agree to provide you
with some tips. However...

00:15:59.120 --> 00:16:05.790
Excuse me, but I slept the whole
flight, and missed out on lunch.

00:16:05.790 --> 00:16:07.870
I hate to have to ask this,

00:16:07.870 --> 00:16:11.000
but could you serve my
master something to eat first?

00:16:11.000 --> 00:16:15.790
Food just seems to go through him,
and he quickly gets hungry again.

00:16:23.290 --> 00:16:29.040
That was delicious. It was worth
the trip here for the dinner alone.

00:16:29.040 --> 00:16:31.290
You are too kind.

00:16:31.290 --> 00:16:36.200
Let me begin by confirming that
you are Mamoru's apprentice, yes?

00:16:36.200 --> 00:16:37.040
Yes.

00:16:37.040 --> 00:16:39.500
Mamoru was an unworthy pupil.

00:16:39.500 --> 00:16:42.700
There is no reason why he should
be taking on an apprentice.

00:16:42.700 --> 00:16:44.040
Do we understand each other?

00:16:44.040 --> 00:16:45.870
Uh, yes...

00:16:45.870 --> 00:16:49.000
I know why Mamoru asked me to do this.

00:16:49.000 --> 00:16:54.870
But I am a busy man, and I don't
have time to take on two apprentices.

00:16:54.870 --> 00:16:59.410
Uncle, I don't think you
need to accommodate this boy.

00:16:59.410 --> 00:17:04.290
Have you forgotten how many years
I begged you to take me on?

00:17:05.540 --> 00:17:09.830
Sir Camelot, I wish to be a magician,
no matter what it takes.

00:17:09.830 --> 00:17:15.080
I have studied on my own, as well.
Please teach me how you do your magic!

00:17:15.080 --> 00:17:20.000
Let's just calm down. A magician
cannot afford to become worked up.

00:17:20.000 --> 00:17:22.950
We are not the ones who
are influenced by others;

00:17:22.950 --> 00:17:26.250
we are the ones who must inspire others.

00:17:28.000 --> 00:17:31.700
Also, as with Dina, who bears
the Camelot family name,

00:17:31.700 --> 00:17:36.750
address me by my first name,
not my last. Call me Gregory.

00:17:36.750 --> 00:17:39.250
All right then, Gregory-<i>sensei</i>.

00:17:39.250 --> 00:17:41.120
Don't call him "sensei" just yet.

00:17:41.120 --> 00:17:44.790
Uncle has still not decided
to take you as his apprentice.

00:17:44.790 --> 00:17:46.290
Dina...

00:17:47.290 --> 00:17:50.330
I'd like to start by seeing your skills.

00:17:50.330 --> 00:17:53.410
Why don't you show me one of your magic tricks?

00:17:53.410 --> 00:17:55.250
R-Right!

00:17:59.330 --> 00:18:05.620
While I have my back turned,
please pick a card and memorize what it is.

00:18:07.580 --> 00:18:09.000
I've got it.

00:18:09.000 --> 00:18:13.450
All right, could you put the card back,
and shuffle the deck, please?

00:18:16.290 --> 00:18:18.910
When you're ready, please set them down.

00:18:18.910 --> 00:18:20.830
Mm-hmm.

00:18:20.830 --> 00:18:22.080
Okay!

00:18:23.330 --> 00:18:24.870
Move!

00:18:27.330 --> 00:18:30.950
Is this the card you selected?

00:18:30.950 --> 00:18:32.830
Wow, you got it!

00:18:32.830 --> 00:18:35.500
Makoto-<i>niisama</i>, that's amazing.

00:18:36.660 --> 00:18:39.250
So, um, how was that?

00:18:39.250 --> 00:18:40.750
Very unaccomplished.

00:18:43.620 --> 00:18:44.750
Still...

00:18:44.750 --> 00:18:47.700
Sensei, why are you even considering this?

00:18:47.700 --> 00:18:52.790
His skills are much too poor.
You can't even call that a magic trick!

00:18:52.790 --> 00:18:56.910
How can you say such a thing?
Makoto's magic trick was incredible!

00:18:56.910 --> 00:19:02.700
Ms. Kana, Yumemi, you don't
even know what true magic is.

00:19:02.700 --> 00:19:05.410
Let me show you a real example.

00:19:09.870 --> 00:19:12.620
Remember which card you picked,

00:19:12.620 --> 00:19:15.620
then put it back anywhere you like.

00:19:28.790 --> 00:19:34.120
Ms. Kana, Yumemi, hold out your hands.

00:19:36.790 --> 00:19:39.700
Those are your cards, right?

00:19:39.700 --> 00:19:41.450
He's right.

00:19:41.450 --> 00:19:45.790
The remaining card is here, Makoto!

00:19:48.200 --> 00:19:50.120
Go ahead and look at it.

00:19:52.120 --> 00:19:54.290
That's my card, all right.

00:19:55.290 --> 00:19:57.450
It's nothing to be surprised by.

00:19:57.450 --> 00:20:01.250
On the contrary, it's easy enough
that even I can perform this trick.

00:20:01.250 --> 00:20:04.830
In that regard, you can't
even call what he did magic.

00:20:04.830 --> 00:20:09.040
Sensei and Mamoru-<i>san </i>can
do even better magic tricks.

00:20:15.040 --> 00:20:16.750
Makoto...

00:20:19.000 --> 00:20:21.830
Dina, are you happy now?

00:20:21.830 --> 00:20:25.410
I think I'll retire to my room now.

00:20:25.410 --> 00:20:28.750
It's been a long trip, and I'm a little tired.

00:20:30.200 --> 00:20:34.830
Boy, I will be in the country
for a couple of weeks.

00:20:34.830 --> 00:20:38.540
During that time, I will let
you show me another trick.

00:20:38.540 --> 00:20:42.870
Meanwhile, get your best
magic trick ready for me.

00:20:42.870 --> 00:20:44.830
R-Right!

00:20:50.120 --> 00:20:54.500
It looks as though the apprenticeship
matter has been settled.

00:20:54.500 --> 00:20:58.080
Now, would you listen seriously
to what I have to say?

00:21:00.200 --> 00:21:04.370
The village believes that ensuring
the safety and lifestyle of the family

00:21:04.370 --> 00:21:09.950
along with preventing the misuse
of Artifacts is what's most important.

00:21:09.950 --> 00:21:16.750
Kana, Yumemi, at present, you are
too unskilled to possess Artifacts.

00:21:16.750 --> 00:21:19.080
As things stand, you, to say
nothing of those around you,

00:21:19.080 --> 00:21:21.660
will be exposed to danger.

00:21:21.660 --> 00:21:22.290
--That's--

00:21:22.290 --> 00:21:22.910
--I need you to return the Artifacts
that are currently in your possession.
--That's--

00:21:22.910 --> 00:21:27.160
--I need you to return the Artifacts
that are currently in your possession.

00:21:27.160 --> 00:21:31.450
You will then leave the mansion,
and move to some other residence.

00:21:33.160 --> 00:21:34.790
You don't get to decide that!

00:21:34.790 --> 00:21:39.290
Taking our Artifacts and telling us to
get out of the mansion is way too bossy!

00:21:39.290 --> 00:21:41.000
We'll never go for that!

00:21:41.000 --> 00:21:46.200
This is the decision of Morrigan Lároutir,
leader of Lároutir Village.

00:21:46.200 --> 00:21:50.000
As long as you live in this house,
you cannot disobey her.

00:21:51.870 --> 00:21:54.120
Isn't that right, Jeeves?

00:21:54.120 --> 00:21:56.750
You are correct.

00:21:59.160 --> 00:22:01.540
Jeeves-<i>san</i>...

00:22:02.290 --> 00:22:08.120
<i>My path now begins</i>

00:22:08.120 --> 00:22:16.500
<i>I've unleashed the hidden light of one future</i>

00:22:20.250 --> 00:22:22.910
<i>I've been on the hunt</i>

00:22:22.910 --> 00:22:26.950
<i>to find my furthest dreams</i>

00:22:26.950 --> 00:22:30.120
<i>I want to shine even brighter</i>

00:22:30.120 --> 00:22:35.200
<i>The "someday" that my former self prayed for</i>

00:22:35.200 --> 00:22:40.370
<i>is still far away, but I'll catch up</i>

00:22:40.370 --> 00:22:45.410
<i>"Miracle" is such an embarrassingly vague word</i>

00:22:45.410 --> 00:22:50.580
<i>My timeframe has neither forever nor a moment</i>

00:22:50.580 --> 00:22:57.830
<i>I move forward one step at a time to my voice</i>

00:22:57.830 --> 00:23:01.620
<i>No matter what awaits me</i>

00:23:01.620 --> 00:23:02.950
<i>beyond this pain</i>

00:23:02.950 --> 00:23:05.200
<i>I'll once again, yes once again</i>

00:23:05.200 --> 00:23:07.950
<i>leap up and shine</i>

00:23:07.950 --> 00:23:11.790
<i>Yeah, I'll put into words</i>

00:23:11.790 --> 00:23:13.330
<i>the view laid out before me</i>

00:23:13.330 --> 00:23:16.580
<i>and let it ring out dozens,</i>

00:23:16.580 --> 00:23:20.250
<i>even hundreds of times</i>

00:23:20.250 --> 00:23:24.540
<i>What color do you suppose love is?</i>

00:23:24.540 --> 00:23:30.250
<i>I've unleashed my hidden light</i>

00:23:32.000 --> 00:23:38.790
"What do you often buy
at the convenience store?"

00:23:39.830 --> 00:23:51.870
"Gregory"

00:23:51.870 --> 00:24:01.790
"See you next time"
